"""Paper 1 · Current Affairs: August, September and October 2026 (October up to the 12th, the last update before the KRIES exam).
75% Karnataka, 25% national. Each month = "1 · Karnataka" (30 Q) + "2 · National" (10 Q). Every fact was checked on the web and the
source is named in each explanation; "Background" questions add settled facts linked to the month's news. Where sources disagreed the
question avoids the disputed detail (e.g. who inaugurated Mysuru Dasara 2026; the 2026 Economics Nobel, not yet confirmed on 12 Oct).
Left out: a September compilation's claim that C. P. Radhakrishnan took office as Vice-President in 2026 (that happened in 2025)."""
